XB-Kidux-Name-en: Scratch
XB-Kidux-Description-en: Create interactive games, animations, and stories with visual coding blocks, as at school. Its characters, backdrops and sounds download from Scratch on demand.
XB-Kidux-Name-es: Scratch
XB-Kidux-Description-es: Crea juegos interactivos, animaciones e historias mediante bloques de programación visual, como en el colegio. Sus personajes, fondos y sonidos se descargan de Scratch bajo demanda.
XB-Kidux-Name-fr: Scratch
XB-Kidux-Description-fr: Crée des jeux interactifs, des animations et des histoires avec des blocs de programmation visuelle, comme à l'école. Ses personnages, arrière-plans et sons se téléchargent depuis Scratch à la demande.
XB-Kidux-Ages: 8-16
XB-Kidux-Before: scratchjr
Description: Kidux learning module: Scratch, stories and games made with blocks
 Kidux is a Debian derivative for a child's first computer. This learning
 module is Scratch's own editor, the one children use at school, served on
 this computer and shown in Chromium, in the child's language, without the
 Scratch website's community. Its library of characters, backdrops and
 sounds comes from the Scratch Foundation's servers, so it needs the
 internet for them. A child saves their projects as files in their own
 folders, and opens them again from there.
 .
 Once it is installed, an adult switches it on for each child on the
 Modules page of the adult panel.
